<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective May 22-28:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 62.39</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 66.45</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 68.32</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 71.75</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$171.90</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$128.93</p>
<p>    Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 92.29</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 23.67</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.37</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 26.16</p>
</text>
